cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the released recordings or the analysis code, please cite this artifact as below."
type: software
title: "EtherSense Artifact: Released Recordings, Analysis Code and Revision Workspace"
abstract: >-
  Anonymous research artifact accompanying the IMWUT submission "Lens-Free, Plug-Free,
  and Retrofit-Free: Repurposing Wi-Fi APs into Ubiquitous Electrical Sentinels".
  Contains the released cable-length and wall-pair IQ recordings, the preprocessing and
  Welch analysis code, and the revision measurement workspace used to produce the
  published spectral measurements.
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
